      "type": "list_item",
      "text": "Being Heumann"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "British actor Ruth Madeley is outstanding as Judith Heumann, the activist who helped fight for anti-discrimination laws for individuals with disabilities, in CODA director Siân Heder’s enthralling film."
