      "type": "heading",
      "text": "The Slightest Touch"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The power of friendship and connection is explored in Rachel Fleit’s soulful and life-affirming documentary, featuring Emma Fogarty and Colin Farrell."
    },
