    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Adam Pearson: Zero Intention of Living Quietly"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Actor, broadcaster, and leading disability advocate Adam Pearson joins us to discuss his career and his influential advocacy work for more inclusive storytelling and authentic representation."
